# Copy to .dev.vars for `wrangler dev`. Never commit .dev.vars.
# Generate a token with: openssl rand -hex 32
# wrangler dev without --local calls the real Workers AI binding and spends Neurons.
# wrangler dev --local keeps remote bindings off.
# Upload size is not a secret. wrangler.toml MAX_UPLOAD_BYTES defaults to
# 1048576. GET /v1/info max_image_bytes is min(524288, MAX_UPLOAD_BYTES - 65536).
# The enforced image-part cap stays 983040.
# TIER is not a secret and is not set in this file. Leave it unset for free.
# [env.paid] sets TIER=paid, MAX_UPLOAD_BYTES=2097152, and
# AUTOFILL_DAILY_NEURON_BUDGET=30000. Paid max_image_bytes is 1048576.
# Paid enforced image cap is 2031616. Daily Neuron cap is 6000 free and
# 30000 paid. A Gemma 4 request with thinking off is about 6.4 Neurons
# (about $0.000070).
# Free: wrangler dev / wrangler deploy
# Paid: wrangler dev --env paid / wrangler deploy --env paid
# Environments do not inherit vars or bindings. Copy .dev.vars for either.
AUTOFILL_TOKEN=replace-me
